    "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 473.733991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘的第十到第六雪鱼洞的石头是个小姑娘，本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，望华岩的瀑布会变色，腾龙洞吞了一整条江芙蓉洞的池子会发光。好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，有人说紫金洞呢黄龙洞呢双河洞呢别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个狠。最后那个金洞洞到今今天都定不了它的成因。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，贵州织金洞最深处立着一根石柱，当地人叫它银羽树，两米来高，通体晶莹剔透，远看像一棵挂满了霜花的树，走近了才发现，它不是树，它是水做的一滴水，十几万年一层一层往上挪，水里的矿物质慢慢沉下来，成出满身花瓣一样的卷曲纹路。树顶上还伸出几根枝杈，跟松树似的。导游每回走到这儿都要停下，来说您去全世界找找找不着第二根这模样的织金洞，敢叫溶洞之王，一多半的底气就压在这根柱子上。联合国的地质专家当年看完站在那儿，愣了好一会儿。最后摇着头说，这东西教科书里写不进去，一根柱子撑起一个洞的名声。您说这得多大分量？第四名，广西桂林卢狄言七十多则辟书，最早的是唐朝贞元。八年一千两百多年前，有人进去过写的字，可附近的村民一直不说把洞口藏起来当避难所，外面改朝换代，打仗，他们躲进洞里出来，又是一条命。解放以后，社会安定了，村民才把这个秘密说出来。您说这个洞是多少人的保命度，那些必书是不是每一笔都在等您去看一座洞，护住了一方人，这比什么宝贝都值钱。讲了这几个地方，评论区好多朋友说年轻时忙没空去，现在退休了，想好好看看带孙子的，想给孩子讲讲这些动力的秘密，自己也说不全。咱们这年纪看景，不光看热闹，是想知道这地底下到底藏着什么，背后有什么故事。可手机上刷完就忘，上网查太乱，翻大布头，眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方的书。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，有自然风光，有历史文化，有民族风情、一个地方一个地方的讲怎么来的，有什么典故，风土人情，几分钟讲的明白，图也印的漂亮一页。翻开就是一幅大画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前先翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不是石头，是故事去不了的地方。翻翻书看看图，也算去过，放茶几上孙子，孙女来了，翻两页长知识。不说，写作文都用得上，老两口晚上翻番，商量明年去哪。比刷手机有意思多了。房子会旧，存款会花完，可千年文化替咱们指路。这个东西传多少代都有价值，守住咱们中国人的文化记忆。这份记忆一旦淡了，想找回来就难了，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代留一份。感兴趣的朋友下方小黄车点进去看看，暂时走不出去，咱就把祖国装进屋里。第三名，贵州绥阳双河洞，五十二具大熊猫化石一万多年前的这洞探了三十多年，探明长度四百八十一公里，亚洲第一。可他最大的秘密不是长度，是他肚子里藏着的东西，还有羚牛、犀牛、剑齿象、四十四种古生物全都完整的保存在洞里，一具大熊猫骨架连牙齿都没掉，这是全世界保存最完整的晚耕新式羚游化石。也是第一个可靠的记录。一万多年前的大熊猫就这么安安静静，躺在贵州的山洞里，等了一万多年，才被人发现，一只大熊猫等了一万多年才被叫醒，这事儿上哪说理去？第二名，浙江桐庐遥临仙境二十多米高的石瀑布，从洞顶一直挂到洞底，七米多宽。这不是真瀑布，是石头长的水滴了。几十万年一层一层沉下来，沉成了瀑布的样子，灯光一打整片石瀑布跟银河倒挂一样，可您知道吗？这片瀑布每一百年才长一厘米，有的石笋长了十几万年才长成。现在这样可就是这么珍贵的石头。以前有人偷把石笋砸下来，拿去卖一块石头，几万年才长成一锤子就没了。后来景区装了监控，派人守着，才保住了这片银河几万年才长成的东西，一锤子就没了，这事想起来就心疼。第一名。湖南张家界黄龙洞，一根石头值一个亿，水潭正中央一根石笋拔地而起，将近二十米，高笔直朝上已经涨了两万年了，还差几米就要顶到洞顶。这根石笋有个名字叫定海神针，景区怕他出什么意外，专门去保险公司给他上了个一亿的保险，一根石头值一个亿。全中国独一份保险公司核保的时候，光评估报告就写了几十页经办人。后来跟人讲干了几十年，保险头一回给一块石头当投保人。您算算他一百年才长两毫米，咱们活一辈子在他身上也就添了薄薄一层。可就是这么一根石头保险公司认了他值一个亿。您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十个溶洞没有一个是光靠好看出名的雪玉洞的石头是个小姑娘。本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，万华岩的瀑布会变色，腾龙洞吞了一整条江，芙蓉洞的池子会发光。银与树是水做的卢迪，岩是保命洞，双河洞藏着五十二具大熊猫摇林仙境是石头长的瀑布，定海神针值一个亿。每一个洞的厉害之处都不在他有多大，在他藏着什么秘密？这十个里头您觉得哪个最离谱？评论区打个序号就行，我看看大伙儿的眼光一不一样，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 650,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00002",
      "start_ms": 650,
      "end_ms": 5150,
      "text": "咱们盘的第十到第六雪鱼洞的石头是个小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5590,
      "end_ms": 8270,
      "text": "本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8810,
      "end_ms": 10730,
      "text": "望华岩的瀑布会变色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11270,
      "end_ms": 15410,
      "text": "腾龙洞吞了一整条江芙蓉洞的池子会发光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15690,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18330,
      "end_ms": 22850,
      "text": "有人说紫金洞呢黄龙洞呢双河洞呢别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23390,
      "end_ms": 25650,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26130,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "一个比一个狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28070,
      "end_ms": 32080,
      "text": "最后那个金洞洞到今今天都定不了它的成因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32400,
      "end_ms": 36280,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36560,
      "end_ms": 38720,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00013",
      "start_ms": 39400,
      "end_ms": 40100,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00014",
      "start_ms": 40280,
      "end_ms": 44180,
      "text": "贵州织金洞最深处立着一根石柱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00015",
      "start_ms": 44660,
      "end_ms": 46260,
      "text": "当地人叫它银羽树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46520,
      "end_ms": 47400,
      "text": "两米来高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47840,
      "end_ms": 49500,
      "text": "通体晶莹剔透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49820,
      "end_ms": 52540,
      "text": "远看像一棵挂满了霜花的树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53100,
      "end_ms": 54460,
      "text": "走近了才发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54620,
      "end_ms": 55360,
      "text": "它不是树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55840,
      "end_ms": 58180,
      "text": "它是水做的一滴水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58300,
      "end_ms": 61155,
      "text": "十几万年一层一层往上挪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00023",
      "start_ms": 61600,
      "end_ms": 63995,
      "text": "水里的矿物质慢慢沉下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64430,
      "end_ms": 67775,
      "text": "成出满身花瓣一样的卷曲纹路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68430,
      "end_ms": 70810,
      "text": "树顶上还伸出几根枝杈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00026",
      "start_ms": 70950,
      "end_ms": 72165,
      "text": "跟松树似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00027",
      "start_ms": 72520,
      "end_ms": 74580,
      "text": "导游每回走到这儿都要停下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74580,
      "end_ms": 81330,
      "text": "来说您去全世界找找找不着第二根这模样的织金洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00029",
      "start_ms": 81390,
      "end_ms": 82870,
      "text": "敢叫溶洞之王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00030",
      "start_ms": 83090,
      "end_ms": 86155,
      "text": "一多半的底气就压在这根柱子上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86560,
      "end_ms": 89540,
      "text": "联合国的地质专家当年看完站在那儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00032",
      "start_ms": 89540,
      "end_ms": 90465,
      "text": "愣了好一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90880,
      "end_ms": 92195,
      "text": "最后摇着头说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92880,
      "end_ms": 94815,
      "text": "这东西教科书里写不进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95190,
      "end_ms": 97955,
      "text": "一根柱子撑起一个洞的名声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98560,
      "end_ms": 99995,
      "text": "您说这得多大分量？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101270,
      "end_ms": 101875,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00038",
      "start_ms": 103290,
      "end_ms": 107170,
      "text": "广西桂林卢狄言七十多则辟书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00039",
      "start_ms": 107370,
      "end_ms": 109230,
      "text": "最早的是唐朝贞元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00040",
      "start_ms": 109290,
      "end_ms": 111505,
      "text": "八年一千两百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00041",
      "start_ms": 111820,
      "end_ms": 113765,
      "text": "有人进去过写的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00042",
      "start_ms": 114140,
      "end_ms": 119410,
      "text": "可附近的村民一直不说把洞口藏起来当避难所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119650,
      "end_ms": 120955,
      "text": "外面改朝换代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00044",
      "start_ms": 121360,
      "end_ms": 121825,
      "text": "打仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00045",
      "start_ms": 122890,
      "end_ms": 124500,
      "text": "他们躲进洞里出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00046",
      "start_ms": 124500,
      "end_ms": 125335,
      "text": "又是一条命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00047",
      "start_ms": 126260,
      "end_ms": 126980,
      "text": "解放以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00048",
      "start_ms": 127340,
      "end_ms": 128585,
      "text": "社会安定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00049",
      "start_ms": 129230,
      "end_ms": 131095,
      "text": "村民才把这个秘密说出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131590,
      "end_ms": 134445,
      "text": "您说这个洞是多少人的保命度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00051",
      "start_ms": 134960,
      "end_ms": 140135,
      "text": "那些必书是不是每一笔都在等您去看一座洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00052",
      "start_ms": 140440,
      "end_ms": 141455,
      "text": "护住了一方人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00053",
      "start_ms": 142380,
      "end_ms": 144145,
      "text": "这比什么宝贝都值钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00054",
      "start_ms": 144410,
      "end_ms": 145435,
      "text": "讲了这几个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145800,
      "end_ms": 149195,
      "text": "评论区好多朋友说年轻时忙没空去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00056",
      "start_ms": 149650,
      "end_ms": 150610,
      "text": "现在退休了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00057",
      "start_ms": 150650,
      "end_ms": 152865,
      "text": "想好好看看带孙子的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00058",
      "start_ms": 153230,
      "end_ms": 155555,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些动力的秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00059",
      "start_ms": 156240,
      "end_ms": 157285,
      "text": "自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00060",
      "start_ms": 157760,
      "end_ms": 159420,
      "text": "咱们这年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00061",
      "start_ms": 159440,
      "end_ms": 160495,
      "text": "不光看热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00062",
      "start_ms": 160820,
      "end_ms": 163345,
      "text": "是想知道这地底下到底藏着什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00063",
      "start_ms": 163590,
      "end_ms": 164675,
      "text": "背后有什么故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00064",
      "start_ms": 165180,
      "end_ms": 166655,
      "text": "可手机上刷完就忘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00065",
      "start_ms": 167140,
      "end_ms": 168355,
      "text": "上网查太乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00066",
      "start_ms": 168740,
      "end_ms": 169580,
      "text": "翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00067",
      "start_ms": 169580,
      "end_ms": 170255,
      "text": "眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00068",
      "start_ms": 170920,
      "end_ms": 176910,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方的书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00069",
      "start_ms": 177130,
      "end_ms": 181065,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00070",
      "start_ms": 181500,
      "end_ms": 182645,
      "text": "有自然风光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182920,
      "end_ms": 183800,
      "text": "有历史文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00072",
      "start_ms": 184040,
      "end_ms": 189315,
      "text": "有民族风情、一个地方一个地方的讲怎么来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00073",
      "start_ms": 189750,
      "end_ms": 190815,
      "text": "有什么典故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00074",
      "start_ms": 191200,
      "end_ms": 192275,
      "text": "风土人情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00075",
      "start_ms": 192780,
      "end_ms": 194325,
      "text": "几分钟讲的明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00076",
      "start_ms": 194740,
      "end_ms": 196690,
      "text": "图也印的漂亮一页。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00077",
      "start_ms": 196690,
      "end_ms": 198005,
      "text": "翻开就是一幅大画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00078",
      "start_ms": 198610,
      "end_ms": 199875,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00079",
      "start_ms": 200170,
      "end_ms": 204020,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前先翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00080",
      "start_ms": 204060,
      "end_ms": 205025,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00081",
      "start_ms": 205700,
      "end_ms": 207435,
      "text": "看的就不是石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00082",
      "start_ms": 207890,
      "end_ms": 210395,
      "text": "是故事去不了的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00083",
      "start_ms": 210660,
      "end_ms": 212450,
      "text": "翻翻书看看图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00084",
      "start_ms": 212710,
      "end_ms": 213695,
      "text": "也算去过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00085",
      "start_ms": 214070,
      "end_ms": 215610,
      "text": "放茶几上孙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00086",
      "start_ms": 215610,
      "end_ms": 216210,
      "text": "孙女来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00087",
      "start_ms": 216210,
      "end_ms": 217930,
      "text": "翻两页长知识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00088",
      "start_ms": 217930,
      "end_ms": 218290,
      "text": "不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00089",
      "start_ms": 218610,
      "end_ms": 219835,
      "text": "写作文都用得上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00090",
      "start_ms": 220310,
      "end_ms": 221695,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻番，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00091",
      "start_ms": 222070,
      "end_ms": 223105,
      "text": "商量明年去哪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00092",
      "start_ms": 223380,
      "end_ms": 224835,
      "text": "比刷手机有意思多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00093",
      "start_ms": 225380,
      "end_ms": 226280,
      "text": "房子会旧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00094",
      "start_ms": 226460,
      "end_ms": 227585,
      "text": "存款会花完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00095",
      "start_ms": 227970,
      "end_ms": 230405,
      "text": "可千年文化替咱们指路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00096",
      "start_ms": 230970,
      "end_ms": 233455,
      "text": "这个东西传多少代都有价值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00097",
      "start_ms": 234250,
      "end_ms": 236675,
      "text": "守住咱们中国人的文化记忆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00098",
      "start_ms": 237100,
      "end_ms": 238795,
      "text": "这份记忆一旦淡了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00099",
      "start_ms": 239330,
      "end_ms": 241130,
      "text": "想找回来就难了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00100",
      "start_ms": 241230,
      "end_ms": 244165,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00101",
      "start_ms": 244390,
      "end_ms": 245895,
      "text": "也给下一代留一份。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00102",
      "start_ms": 247330,
      "end_ms": 250715,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友下方小黄车点进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00103",
      "start_ms": 250970,
      "end_ms": 251965,
      "text": "暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00104",
      "start_ms": 252740,
      "end_ms": 254725,
      "text": "咱就把祖国装进屋里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00105",
      "start_ms": 255690,
      "end_ms": 256395,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00106",
      "start_ms": 256740,
      "end_ms": 258465,
      "text": "贵州绥阳双河洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00107",
      "start_ms": 258780,
      "end_ms": 265645,
      "text": "五十二具大熊猫化石一万多年前的这洞探了三十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00108",
      "start_ms": 266570,
      "end_ms": 268775,
      "text": "探明长度四百八十一公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00109",
      "start_ms": 269050,
      "end_ms": 269835,
      "text": "亚洲第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00110",
      "start_ms": 270770,
      "end_ms": 272865,
      "text": "可他最大的秘密不是长度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00111",
      "start_ms": 273160,
      "end_ms": 275155,
      "text": "是他肚子里藏着的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00112",
      "start_ms": 276070,
      "end_ms": 284085,
      "text": "还有羚牛、犀牛、剑齿象、四十四种古生物全都完整的保存在洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00113",
      "start_ms": 284510,
      "end_ms": 287880,
      "text": "一具大熊猫骨架连牙齿都没掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00114",
      "start_ms": 288060,
      "end_ms": 293305,
      "text": "这是全世界保存最完整的晚耕新式羚游化石。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00115",
      "start_ms": 293980,
      "end_ms": 295840,
      "text": "也是第一个可靠的记录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00116",
      "start_ms": 296420,
      "end_ms": 299920,
      "text": "一万多年前的大熊猫就这么安安静静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00117",
      "start_ms": 299940,
      "end_ms": 301460,
      "text": "躺在贵州的山洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00118",
      "start_ms": 301940,
      "end_ms": 303000,
      "text": "等了一万多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00119",
      "start_ms": 303000,
      "end_ms": 303860,
      "text": "才被人发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00120",
      "start_ms": 304300,
      "end_ms": 306900,
      "text": "一只大熊猫等了一万多年才被叫醒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00121",
      "start_ms": 307380,
      "end_ms": 308940,
      "text": "这事儿上哪说理去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00122",
      "start_ms": 309800,
      "end_ms": 310440,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00123",
      "start_ms": 310680,
      "end_ms": 314700,
      "text": "浙江桐庐遥临仙境二十多米高的石瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00124",
      "start_ms": 315220,
      "end_ms": 317680,
      "text": "从洞顶一直挂到洞底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00125",
      "start_ms": 317960,
      "end_ms": 318880,
      "text": "七米多宽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00126",
      "start_ms": 319220,
      "end_ms": 320740,
      "text": "这不是真瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00127",
      "start_ms": 321080,
      "end_ms": 323645,
      "text": "是石头长的水滴了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00128",
      "start_ms": 323770,
      "end_ms": 326210,
      "text": "几十万年一层一层沉下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00129",
      "start_ms": 326410,
      "end_ms": 328130,
      "text": "沉成了瀑布的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00130",
      "start_ms": 328650,
      "end_ms": 332490,
      "text": "灯光一打整片石瀑布跟银河倒挂一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00131",
      "start_ms": 332810,
      "end_ms": 333690,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00132",
      "start_ms": 333790,
      "end_ms": 337390,
      "text": "这片瀑布每一百年才长一厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00133",
      "start_ms": 337950,
      "end_ms": 342010,
      "text": "有的石笋长了十几万年才长成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00134",
      "start_ms": 342050,
      "end_ms": 345590,
      "text": "现在这样可就是这么珍贵的石头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00135",
      "start_ms": 346450,
      "end_ms": 350030,
      "text": "以前有人偷把石笋砸下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00136",
      "start_ms": 350470,
      "end_ms": 353295,
      "text": "拿去卖一块石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00137",
      "start_ms": 353610,
      "end_ms": 356925,
      "text": "几万年才长成一锤子就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00138",
      "start_ms": 357300,
      "end_ms": 359015,
      "text": "后来景区装了监控，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00139",
      "start_ms": 359330,
      "end_ms": 360245,
      "text": "派人守着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00140",
      "start_ms": 360530,
      "end_ms": 365000,
      "text": "才保住了这片银河几万年才长成的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00141",
      "start_ms": 365020,
      "end_ms": 366325,
      "text": "一锤子就没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00142",
      "start_ms": 366730,
      "end_ms": 368435,
      "text": "这事想起来就心疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00143",
      "start_ms": 368980,
      "end_ms": 369525,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00144",
      "start_ms": 370020,
      "end_ms": 371655,
      "text": "湖南张家界黄龙洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00145",
      "start_ms": 372040,
      "end_ms": 374095,
      "text": "一根石头值一个亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00146",
      "start_ms": 374540,
      "end_ms": 378075,
      "text": "水潭正中央一根石笋拔地而起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00147",
      "start_ms": 378530,
      "end_ms": 379730,
      "text": "将近二十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00148",
      "start_ms": 379730,
      "end_ms": 382605,
      "text": "高笔直朝上已经涨了两万年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00149",
      "start_ms": 382810,
      "end_ms": 384435,
      "text": "还差几米就要顶到洞顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00150",
      "start_ms": 384890,
      "end_ms": 387885,
      "text": "这根石笋有个名字叫定海神针，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00151",
      "start_ms": 388690,
      "end_ms": 390225,
      "text": "景区怕他出什么意外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00152",
      "start_ms": 390580,
      "end_ms": 393465,
      "text": "专门去保险公司给他上了个一亿的保险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00153",
      "start_ms": 393730,
      "end_ms": 395295,
      "text": "一根石头值一个亿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00154",
      "start_ms": 395800,
      "end_ms": 399480,
      "text": "全中国独一份保险公司核保的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00155",
      "start_ms": 399520,
      "end_ms": 403630,
      "text": "光评估报告就写了几十页经办人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00156",
      "start_ms": 403630,
      "end_ms": 405580,
      "text": "后来跟人讲干了几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00157",
      "start_ms": 405620,
      "end_ms": 408575,
      "text": "保险头一回给一块石头当投保人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00158",
      "start_ms": 408900,
      "end_ms": 411975,
      "text": "您算算他一百年才长两毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00159",
      "start_ms": 412540,
      "end_ms": 416085,
      "text": "咱们活一辈子在他身上也就添了薄薄一层。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00160",
      "start_ms": 416970,
      "end_ms": 421625,
      "text": "可就是这么一根石头保险公司认了他值一个亿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00161",
      "start_ms": 423050,
      "end_ms": 425375,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00162",
      "start_ms": 425830,
      "end_ms": 427115,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00163",
      "start_ms": 427640,
      "end_ms": 434035,
      "text": "这十个溶洞没有一个是光靠好看出名的雪玉洞的石头是个小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00164",
      "start_ms": 434260,
      "end_ms": 436875,
      "text": "本溪水洞飘着一条地下银河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00165",
      "start_ms": 437630,
      "end_ms": 439715,
      "text": "万华岩的瀑布会变色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00166",
      "start_ms": 440100,
      "end_ms": 442045,
      "text": "腾龙洞吞了一整条江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00167",
      "start_ms": 442530,
      "end_ms": 444725,
      "text": "芙蓉洞的池子会发光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00168",
      "start_ms": 445680,
      "end_ms": 447810,
      "text": "银与树是水做的卢迪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00169",
      "start_ms": 447810,
      "end_ms": 448875,
      "text": "岩是保命洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00170",
      "start_ms": 449460,
      "end_ms": 454925,
      "text": "双河洞藏着五十二具大熊猫摇林仙境是石头长的瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00171",
      "start_ms": 455410,
      "end_ms": 457355,
      "text": "定海神针值一个亿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00172",
      "start_ms": 457880,
      "end_ms": 461035,
      "text": "每一个洞的厉害之处都不在他有多大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00173",
      "start_ms": 461830,
      "end_ms": 463295,
      "text": "在他藏着什么秘密？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00174",
      "start_ms": 463840,
      "end_ms": 466745,
      "text": "这十个里头您觉得哪个最离谱？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00175",
      "start_ms": 467040,
      "end_ms": 468575,
      "text": "评论区打个序号就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00176",
      "start_ms": 468930,
      "end_ms": 471090,
      "text": "我看看大伙儿的眼光一不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00177",
      "start_ms": 471150,
      "end_ms": 471850,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14fbacb5fb09ed50_s00178",
      "start_ms": 472030,
      "end_ms": 473635,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
